{"id":"f00d8c022b23a0a5","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-simple-martingale.md","title":"简单与近简单鞅","display":"df-simple-martingale — 简单与近简单鞅","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-simple-martingale","aliases":["43-df-simple-martingale"],"display":"df-simple-martingale — 简单与近简单鞅","depends_on":["[[43-df-partial-martingale]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Definition 12.3.1 (Ambos-Spies–Mayordomo–Wang–Zheng)","source_printed_pages":"332","source_pdf_pages":"352","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-simple-martingale"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-simple-martingale</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simple-martingale — 简单与近简单鞅"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"df8eac4626d45afe\" href=\"?note=df8eac4626d45afe\" title=\"43-df-partial-martingale\">43-df-partial-martingale</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 12.3.1 (Ambos-Spies–Mayordomo–Wang–Zheng)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"332"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"352"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(m:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)\">\\(D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df8eac4626d45afe\" href=\"?note=df8eac4626d45afe\" title=\"43-df-partial-martingale\">43-df-partial-martingale</a>。定义部分版本；限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(D=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 即为总鞅版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimpleMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1)\\;\\forall i&lt;2\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau i\\in D\\}\\;( m(\\sigma i)\\in\\{m(\\sigma),(1+q)m(\\sigma),(1-q)m(\\sigma)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SimpleMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1)\\;\\forall i&lt;2\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau i\\in D\\}\\;( m(\\sigma i)\\in\\{m(\\sigma),(1+q)m(\\sigma),(1-q)m(\\sigma)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlmostSimpleMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\exists Q\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1)\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\infty\\land\\forall i&lt;2\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau i\\in D\\}\\;(\\exists q\\in Q\\;m(\\sigma i)\\in\\{m(\\sigma),(1+q)m(\\sigma),(1-q)m(\\sigma)\\})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AlmostSimpleMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\exists Q\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1)\\;\\bigl(0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\infty\\land\\forall i&lt;2\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau i\\in D\\}\\;(\\exists q\\in Q\\;m(\\sigma i)\\in\\{m(\\sigma),(1+q)m(\\sigma),(1-q)m(\\sigma)\\})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>倍率约束的全部取值点在声明域内；前缀闭性和兄弟公平性仍由PartialMartingale要求。简单鞅使用一个有理比例，近简单鞅使用有限非空比例集。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definition 12.3.1 (Ambos-Spies–Mayordomo–Wang–Zheng)。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-partial-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-partial-martingale]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-partial-martingale","status":"resolved","id":"df8eac4626d45afe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$，$D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)$；$\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}$ 见 [[43-df-partial-martingale]]。定义部分版本；限制 $D=2^{<\\omega}$ 即为总鞅版本。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m:2^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"D=\\operatorname{dom}(m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}","display":false},{"tex":"D=2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimpleMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\exists q\\in\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1)\\;\\forall i<2\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau i\\in D\\}\\;( m(\\sigma i)\\in\\{m(\\sigma),(1+q)m(\\sigma),(1-q)m(\\sigma)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AlmostSimpleMartingale}(m)\\iff\\operatorname{PartialMartingale}(m)\\land\\exists Q\\subseteq\\mathbb Q\\cap(0,1)\\;\\bigl(0<|Q|<\\infty\\land\\forall i<2\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\{\\tau\\in D:\\tau i\\in D\\}\\;(\\exists q\\in Q\\;m(\\sigma i)\\in\\{m(\\sigma),(1+q)m(\\sigma),(1-q)m(\\sigma)\\})\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1856,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-283","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-simple-martingale]] — 简单与近简单鞅"},{"id":"d6939d231a5b02cf","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["df8eac4626d45afe"]}